{number: 18}
{title: I Surrender All}
{key: D}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[D] All to Jesus [A] I surrender,
[Bm] All to [G] Him I [A] freely [D] give;
[D] I will ever [A] love and trust Him,
[Bm] In His [G] presence [A] daily [D] live.
[D] I surrender [Em] all, [A] I surrender [D] all; [A]
[D] All to Thee, my [G] blessed Savior,
[D] I sur-[A] render [D] all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
