[Bm] Truly [G] know that [A] Thou art [D] mine.
[D] I surrender [Em] all, [A] I surrender [D] all; [A]
[D] All to Thee, my [G] blessed Savior,
[D] I sur-[A] render [D] all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[D] All to Jesus [A] I surrender,
[Bm] Lord, I [G] give my-[A] self to [D] Thee;
